# ---- Personal data: never commit ----
# Expenses, income and reminders live in data/, and logs/actions.log records
# every tool call including amounts and descriptions. This repo is public, so
# whole directories are ignored rather than single filenames: an exact pattern
# like "data/tasks.db" would not have caught SQLite's -wal / -shm sidecars, a
# rotated log, or a second database added later.
data/
logs/
*.db
*.db-*
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
